OL,7,G1930 70 Up: The Victorians
OL,8,     FRecently rediscovered and
OL,9,     Fremastered footage of people in
OL,10,     Ftheir Seventies filmed and
OL,11,     Fbroadcast in 1965, the year after
OL,12,     Fthe 7 Up documentary that began
OL,13,     Fthe Up series. Those involved had
OL,14,     Fbeen born into Queen Victoria's
OL,15,     Fimperial Britain, when life
OL,16,     Fexpectancy was under 50 and
OL,17,     Fworkhouses took in the old and
OL,18,     Fdestitute. Restored and re-edited,
OL,19,     Fthe film hears them talking about
OL,20,     Fwork, money, loneliness, health
OL,21,     Fand dying and their hopes in 1965
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/7
